%    \begin{macrocode}
# The `hep-math` package

Math macros for operators, derivatives, delimiters, bra-ket notation
and expectation values

## Introduction

The `hep-math` package extends `mathtools` and `amsmath` with
HEP-oriented math notation. It provides math-only command definitions,
improved overlines and arrow accents, operator names, fractions and unit
helpers, differentials and derivative builders, paired delimiters,
probabilities, brackets, quantum-mechanical bra-ket notation, matrix
elements, and expectation values.

To use the package place `\usepackage{hep-math}` in the preamble.

